WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
In a paused NASA video, press Command–Shift–2, drag around “Earthrise” and paste the title into Notes.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
In a screenshot of TapScribe’s Mac settings, scoop the transcript folder path and paste it into Finder’s Go to Folder field.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
On a scanned ebook page from The Wonderful Wizard of Oz, scoop “Uncle Henry never laughed.” and paste it into your reading notes.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.500
For a PDF table, press Command–Shift–T for Copy as Table. Select the ledger, including all four columns.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.000
Paste into Excel. The five rows fill A1 through D5, including the empty description cell.
